DESCRIPTION:<a href="https://tfl.gov.uk/tube-dlr-overground/status/?Input=&lineIds=&dateTypeSelect=Future%20date&direction=&startDate=2026-09-24T09:54:38&endDate=2026-09-25T00:29:00">Disruption map.</a>\n\nCentral Line: Severe delays between North Acton and Ealing Broadway/West Ruislip and between Leytonstone and Epping/Hainault via Newbury Park due to an earlier signal failure at Leytonstone. Tickets will be accepted on London Buses\, Liberty line\, Chiltern\, Great Western Railway and Elizabeth line via reasonable routes. MINOR DELAYS on the rest of the line. 
